  Help_WIFI_SECURITY     = 'psk = a password (WPA2-Personal, the Wi-Fi password above); peap or tls = WPA2/WPA3-Enterprise with the 802.1X settings below (the same account or certificate as on the cable). WPA3-Enterprise networks (SHA-256, protected management frames) are joined too.'
