  Help_DOT1X             = 'For switch ports that admit only authenticated devices. off; peap = an account and its password (PEAP-MSCHAPv2, e.g. Windows NPS with domain accounts); tls = a certificate of the device (EAP-TLS, e.g. from AD CS), sent with the 802.1X... button. The address is asked once the port is open. A port that does not answer 802.1X at all: after 15 s the network without it (no authenticator), so a device set up for 802.1X works on any switch. A password the server refuses is tried again only after an hour (the account is not locked).'
